<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi authorities arrested several suspected smugglers tied to a boat sinking that killed three children in Erbil and detained another smuggling suspect in a separate case, while Kurdish security forces also made a related arrest. Turkish forces partially withdrew from the Zilkan camp in Nineveh and a drug squad in Kirkuk dismantled a cross-border trafficking ring. A Jewish museum opened in Baghdad and Iran's parliament speaker met Iraqi militia leaders, prompting US officials to state readiness to assist Erbil after a recent missile strike. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOS3pKZnZPcHlEQm5QZTdkVEk0NmJXYTNyTXZCVl9ReEJwcFlfYnVTS3gwV05lcnItRlN0Z3d3QldWdksxR1lXMVI5Q1ZmRUZ2c2VYaXpHTmVVRWdROWU0a1V2Sm05Tm9BNk1UR200NElZS0xqR2RTeE1DMk1RbkZubGdHRUhrMnBUYi1KR3lVMUx6OTlmQ2tkTjBIalhCbldYM2tLUlhYX0xGRHozSWFKdWhjM2R5dnN1ZjJGbGxLYkFNQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Syrian Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOZC1vNEhEdUd6S1R4WXJUcUZZNm9yYnFfQXVKaUs2a2JuUzdoWWl2b0xDaEdSQk5EYzdXek56bmJvMV9KQlNVdmlqaDFNM2xVdW1UMExTR09nUC01cm5tQkQzRVBHdC0zUHE0STJGVlZ4MVFxd2U2YlVtQjlsOEk2NGY3VDF4YzByTUZhZ3NxU0hCWTNxSGgxY1hjMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;IraqiNews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQazZZYUhyeEdRREhqckZOV0RBaVFFcElqXzlCbjBBNmtUSFB4QVZ0TlhZU3NWU1J5TUlVRFExWWtDUXZ3STF4VlEzVXJDR2x3Z1NYSTVCeTZhbTdsWWRlVzR4YnBPX284RGVvZnlIaGRRMExhT2ZRdzh2OHh2NUhJcjJpbTBQRVNqcENiemNoeGlObEstVXJhUE1ObGdfOTFOUkRXTXBCN0dPM1dHR2N6Yk5tNzJXYlZxMTZvdA?oc=5&quot;&gt;MEMRI | Middle East Media Research Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNNG5RYnpSdnYxWXlpV1J